wpa_supplicant is the WPA/WPA2 client for wifi, with wpa_cli and wpa_passphrase
built for nl80211 with the internal crypto, so WPA2-PSK works with no OpenSSL.
WPA3 (SAE) and WPA-Enterprise are not enabled in this port yet.
upstream: https://w1.fi/wpa_supplicant/
